        <mxCell id="p4c3" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontColor=#333333;" value="Sheet &#39;AC Summary&#39; A1:DH150: investment-level roll-up as at 2025-06-30. Three stacked sections (AC Fund (Aust) rows 7-40, Active Income Portfolio - Held in ACF as Pilot rows 47-107, AC Sub Fund (Aust) rows 123-139), each ending in a &#39;Do not delete&#39; sentinel row and a &#39;Fund Level&#39; total. Each investment row is repeated across FIVE identical column panels side by side (current LTD A-V, MTD movement X-AS, prior month AT-BO, QTD movement BQ-CL, prior quarter CM-DH); they are unpivoted below via panel_code." vertex="1">
