        <mxCell id="p5c3" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontColor=#333333;" value="Sheet &#39;ACF Investment summary&#39; A1:AO2248: transaction-level ledger as at 2025-06-30, headed &#39;For accounts review only&#39;. Hierarchy: 34 investment blocks -&gt; optional &#39;Facility Limit&#39; row (15) -&gt; ledger lines (1,592; 86 of them in a &#39;Commitment Fee&#39; sub-block) -&gt; &#39;Subtotal&#39; (91) -&gt; &#39;Investment Total&#39; (name in column AL, e.g. &#39;Mapei Total&#39;), ending in one &#39;Fund Total&#39;. Rows 1-6 carry the report header and fund-level totals; row 7 is the column header, which is repeated before each block. Each line is a period (start H, end I) of a drawdown / rollover / repayment / fee event. ACF has an extra column AA (late repayment rolled over), so columns AA onward are shifted by one vs the ACSF tab." vertex="1">
