        <mxCell id="p6c2" parent="1" style="text;html=1;fontSize=18;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" value="ACSF Investment Summary  (workbook: Investment Summary 2025-06)" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="28" width="2600" x="40" y="18" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p6c3" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontColor=#333333;" value="Sheet &#39;ACSF Investment Summary&#39; A1:AO662: transaction-level ledger as at 2025-06-30, headed &#39;For accounts review only&#39;. Hierarchy: 17 investment blocks -&gt; optional &#39;Facility Limit&#39; row (4) -&gt; ledger lines (413; 1 of them in a &#39;Commitment Fee&#39; sub-block) -&gt; &#39;Subtotal&#39; (31) -&gt; &#39;Investment Total&#39; (name in column AL, e.g. &#39;Mapei Total&#39;), ending in one &#39;Fund Total&#39;. Rows 1-6 carry the report header and fund-level totals; row 7 is the column header, which is repeated before each block. Each line is a period (start H, end I) of a drawdown / rollover / repayment / fee event. ACSF splits other income into transaction-currency (AF) and AUD (AG), and has no column for late repayment rolled over." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="84" width="1585" x="40" y="48" as="geometry" />
