        <mxCell id="p7c3" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontColor=#333333;" value="Sheet &#39;ACF Bond Summary&#39; A1:AA134, titled &#39;Bond Summary June 25&#39; (B2). Three stacked blocks: (1) holdings, rows 4-64, one row per bond (61), all &#39;Buy&#39;, with a &#39;Total&#39; row (68); (2) &#39;Repayments for June&#39; list, rows 73-108 (36 rows: Security Name / Settle / Amount); (3) a small reconciliation block &#39;LTD&#39; / &#39;AI ACF Book&#39;, rows 114-117. Rows 1-2 are group labels over the header (row 3): transaction codes BUY (E, H, J, K), IN+ (V) and PAYD (Y), plus &#39;Purchase with premium&#39;, &#39;Accrued Interest on Purchase&#39;, &#39;Unamortised principal&#39;, &#39;Fair Value&#39;. Holdings are keyed by ISIN (AU3FN...), not by an internal security ID." vertex="1">
